    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "C17C7EAC19FDD77C",
      "text": "那么话不多说，开始支援！\\n我们来交换宝可梦吧～！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "C17C7FAC19FDD92F",
      "text": "够豪爽～！\\n我的话当然是选铝钢龙！\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]哥姐们你要选哪只呢？[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "C17C7CAC19FDD416",
      "text": "是[VAR 0x0101(0001)]啊，选得好！\\n不愧是冠军的宝可梦！\\c\\n虽然我很怕麻烦，\\n但我会好～好照顾这家伙的。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
